TITLE Albite dissolution with H2S gas at 200C
SOLUTION 1
    temp      200
    pH        2 charge
    Fe(3)     4 mmol/kgw
    Fe(2)     4 mmol/kgw
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g)    5
KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0    1
        -m     1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 1000 in 100
END
